OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies in hospital three weeks
OL,4,Aafter crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver in her 70s has died in
OL,7,Fhospital three weeks after her car
OL,8,Fcrashed with a people carrier.
OL,10,FThe woman was driving a grey Ford
OL,11,FFiesta southbound on the B1159
OL,12,FBrumstead Road, Stalham, when it
OL,13,Fcollided with a grey Ford S-Max heading
OL,14,Fin the opposite direction.
OL,16,FPolice said it happened at the Stepping
OL,17,FStone Lane junction at 14:00 BST on 2
OL,18,FSeptember. The woman was taken to
OL,19,Fhospital but died of her injuries on
OL,20,FSaturday.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
